        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Viktor Kassai\n- Roles: Football referees\n- Events: 2010 FIFA World Cup, 2011 UEFA Champions League Final\n- Places: Wembley Stadium, London\n- Organizations: UEFA\n\nFacts:\n- Viktor Kassai was born on 10 September 1975.\n- Viktor Kassai is a Hungarian football referee.\n- Viktor Kassai participated in the 2010 FIFA World Cup.\n- The 2011 UEFA Champions League Final was played on 28 May 2011 at Wembley Stadium in London.\n- The 2011 UEFA Champions League Final decided the winner of the 2010–11 UEFA Champions League season.\n- Viktor Kassai refereed the 2011 UEFA Champions League Final.",
